          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elija na Ahasia omorwoti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ogokwa kw’Ahabu abanto ba Moabu bakaanga koigwera Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahasia omorwoti akagwa korwa ase egesona kia irongo korwa ase enyomba yaye y’oborwoti agwo Samaria, na akaba orwarete. Ase ayio agatoma abanto, akabateebia: “Genda ase Baali‐Sebubu, enyasae y’Ekironi, moyeborie gose ningwene korwa ase oborwaire obo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omomalaika bw’Omonene agateebia Elija Omotisibi: “Imoka ogende, oumerane nabaanto baria omorwoti Ahasia atomire, obaborie: Inee! Nase ki mokogenda koboria Baali‐Sebubu, enyasae y’Ekironi? Nekiagera mokagete ng’a Nyasae tari ase Abaisraeli?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio aya nar’Omonene atebiire: Aye tokogwena korwa ase amaote korende ekeene, goika okwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bono Elija akagakora buna Omonene amochigete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na abanto baria batometwe bakairana gochia ase omorwoti, nere akababoria: “Ninki kiagera mwairana?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakairaneria, bakamoteebia: “Omonto nachicha oumerana naintwe, ototeebia ng’a toirane gocha asore, aye omorwoti gwatotomete, na kogoteebia ng’a aya nar’Omonene atebiire: Nase ki ogotoma koboria Baali‐Sebubu, enyasae y’Ekironi? Nekiagera okagete ng’a Nyasae tari ase Abaisraeli? Ase ayio tokogwena korwa ase amaote ao, korende ekeene, goika okwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akababoria: “Naki omonto oyio arenge, oyio ochicha oumerana nainwe, na obateebia amang’ana ayio?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamoiraneria: “Igo abegete eganchwa eroisirie korwa ase amarionya, na bweboeretie orokini rwe riiyo kenema kiaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akabateebia: “Ekeene, oyio n’Elija Omotisibi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti agatomera Elija omotang’ani bw’abasikari emerongo etano, amo nabarwani baye emerongo etano. Omotang’ani oria akanyora Elija oikaransete ase egechuria ki’egetunwa, akamoteebia: “Aye omonto o Nyasae, omorwoti oteebire ng’a otirimboke ogende asare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elija akairaneria omotang’ani oria bw’abasikari emerongo etano: “Onye inche inde omonto o Nyasae, tiga omorero orwe igoro ogosambe na kogosiria, aye amo nabarwani bao emerongo etano.” Erio kegima omorero okarwa igoro, ogasamba omotang’ani oria amo nabarwani baye emerongo etano, okabasiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende omorwoti agatoma omotang’ani onde bw’abasikari emerongo etano, amo nabarwani baye emerongo etano. Nere agatiira, agateebia Elija: “Aye omonto o Nyasae, omorwoti ochikiire ng’a otirimboke bwango, ogende asare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Elija akabairaneria: “Onye inche inde omonto o Nyasae, tiga omorero orwe igoro ogosambe na kogosiria, aye amo nabarwani bao emerongo etano.” Erio omorero okarwa igoro, ogasamba omotang’ani oria amo nabarwani baye emerongo etano, okabasiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende omorwoti agatoma omotang’ani onde bw’abasikari emerongo etano amo nabarwani baye emerongo etano; nere agatiira, na gaikire aroro agatugama inse akaumama ase obosio bw’Elija, akamosorora, akamoteebia: “Aye omonto o Nyasae, nagosabire, tiga obogima bwane na obw’abasomba bao aba emerongo etano bobe obw’engencho enene asore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora omorero okarwa igoro ogasamba abatang’ani baria babere b’abarwani emerongo etano, amo nabarwani babo bonsi, korende koranche, tiga obogima bwane bobe obw’engencho enene asore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omomalaika bw’Omonene agateebia Elija: “Tirimboka, ogende amo nere; tobaisa komwoboa.” Erio Elija akaimoka, agatirimboka, akagenda amo nere ase omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elija agateebia omorwoti: “Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Ekiagera aye gwatomire abanto koboria korwa ase Baali‐Sebubu, enyasae y’Ekironi, okarengereria ng’a Nyasae tari ase Abaisraeli okoboria amang’ana, aye tokogwena korwa ase amaote ao, korende ekeene, goika okwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Ahasia agakwa buna Omonene akwanete goetera ase Elija. Ahasia tabwate omwana omomura; ase igo Yoramu momura omwabo akaba omorwoti ase ribaga riaye, ase omwaka o kabere bw’okogaamba kwa Yehoramu mosinto o Yehosafati, omorwoti bw’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi igoro y’Ahasia, na aya akorete, nigo ariikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
